.Dd April 14, 2026
.Dt PODCAST-MGR.IEEE829 7
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm podcast-mgr.ieee829
.Nd test documentation per IEEE 829-2008
.Sh DESCRIPTION
This document provides the software test documentation for
.Nm podcast-mgr
version 1.0 in accordance with IEEE 829-2008
.Em Standard for Software and System Test Documentation .
.Pp
Sections correspond to the IEEE 829 document types:
test plan, test design specification, test case specification,
test procedure specification, test log, test incident report, and
test summary report.
.Sh TEST PLAN (IEEE 829 \(sc 5.2)
.Ss Test Plan Identifier
TP-PODCAST-MGR-1.0
.Ss Introduction
This plan covers verification of
.Nm podcast-mgr
v1.0 consisting of
.Nm index.cgi
.Pq FastCGI worker
and
.Nm podcast.sh
.Pq tcsh cron script .
Testing is performed by the sole developer prior to release tagging.
No automated test harness exists; verification is a combination of
static analysis, manual functional testing, and dependency CVE scanning.
.Ss Test Items
.Bl -bullet -compact
.It
.Pa main.c
\(em compiled to
.Pa index.cgi
.It
.Pa sandbox.h
.It
.Pa podcast.sh
.It
.Pa feeds.xsd
.El
.Ss Features to be Tested
.Bl -tag -width "FT-06"
.It Sy FT-01
HTTP route dispatch and method enforcement.
.It Sy FT-02
Feed subscription CRUD via the web UI.
.It Sy FT-03
Atomic write and rollback on
.Pa feeds.xml .
.It Sy FT-04
Field validation: presence, length, and enumerated value constraints.
.It Sy FT-05
XML load: symlink rejection, regular-file check, size cap.
.It Sy FT-06
Static analysis: absence of CWE-classified defects.
.It Sy FT-07
Dependency CVE status.
.It Sy FT-08
.Pa podcast.sh
schedule filtering and episode download.
.El
.Ss Features Not to be Tested
.Bl -bullet -compact
.It
Browser rendering and JavaScript behaviour of htmx.
.It
HTTP server (nginx/lighttpd) configuration.
.It
Network availability of RSS feed URLs.
.It
Sandbox kernel enforcement (requires the target platform kernel).
.El
.Ss Approach
Static analysis is the primary verification method.
Manual functional testing is performed by the developer in a local
FastCGI environment.
CVE scanning is automated via OSV batch API query against the SBOM.
.Ss Pass/Fail Criteria
.Bl -bullet -compact
.It
cppcheck reports zero findings of severity error, warning, or style.
.It
OSV CVE scan reports zero findings against all versioned components.
.It
All manual test cases execute without unexpected errors.
.It
.Pa feeds.xml
written by
.Nm index.cgi
validates against
.Pa feeds.xsd .
.El
.Ss Suspension and Resumption
Testing is suspended if cppcheck reports any error-severity finding.
The finding must be resolved before manual testing proceeds.
.Ss Test Deliverables
.Bl -bullet -compact
.It
.Pa sbom.json
\(em component inventory.
.It
.Pa podcast_mgr.sarif
\(em static analysis and CVE scan results.
.It
This document
.Pq Pa podcast-mgr.ieee829.7 .
.El
.Ss Schedule
All testing is performed in a single session prior to tagging
.Sy v1.0 .
Estimated duration: two hours.
.Ss Risks
Single-operator testing has no independent review.
Risk is mitigated by automated static analysis and CVE scanning.
.Sh TEST DESIGN SPECIFICATION (IEEE 829 \(sc 5.4)
.Ss Test Design Identifier
TD-PODCAST-MGR-1.0
.Ss Features to be Tested
All features listed in
.Sx TEST PLAN ,
subsection
.Sx Features to be Tested .
.Ss Approach Refinements
.Bl -tag -width "Static"
.It Static
cppcheck with
.Fl -enable=all ,
.Fl -std=c11 ,
missing-include suppressed.
SARIF output captured to
.Pa podcast_mgr.sarif .
.It CVE
OSV
.Pa /v1/querybatch
endpoint called with all PURL-identified versioned components from
.Pa sbom.json .
Results embedded in
.Pa podcast_mgr.sarif .
.It Manual
Developer loads the SPA in a browser connected to a running FastCGI
worker.
Each test case is executed in sequence.
Pass/fail is recorded by observation.
.El
.Sh TEST CASE SPECIFICATION (IEEE 829 \(sc 5.5)
.Ss TC-01 \(em Route dispatch: valid GET
.Bl -tag -width "Expected" -compact
.It Input
.Ic GET /podcast/index.cgi/list
.It Expected
HTTP 200, Content-Type text/html, non-empty body containing card list
or empty-state Add Feed button.
.It Pass criterion
Response body contains
.Li hx-get
attributes referencing
.Li /edit
and
.Li /delete
routes.
.El
.Ss TC-02 \(em Route dispatch: wrong method
.Bl -tag -width "Expected" -compact
.It Input
.Ic GET /podcast/index.cgi/save
with title, url, scope, day, pull_time query parameters.
.It Expected
HTTP 200, error partial containing
.Dq Method not allowed.
.It Pass criterion
No entry is added to the in-memory database.
.El
.Ss TC-03 \(em Add subscription: valid
.Bl -tag -width "Expected" -compact
.It Input
.Ic POST /podcast/index.cgi/save
with fields:
title=\(lqTest Feed\(rq,
url=\(lqhttps://example.com/feed.rss\(rq,
scope=\(lqlatest\(rq,
day=\(lqDaily\(rq,
pull_time=\(lq06\(rq.
.It Expected
HTTP 200, list partial containing the new card.
.Pa feeds.xml
updated with the new entry.
.It Pass criterion
.Ic xmlstarlet val -e -s feeds.xsd feeds.xml
exits 0.
.El
.Ss TC-04 \(em Add subscription: missing field
.Bl -tag -width "Expected" -compact
.It Input
.Ic POST /podcast/index.cgi/save
with
.Va url
omitted.
.It Expected
HTTP 200, error partial containing
.Dq Required field is missing.
.It Pass criterion
.Pa feeds.xml
is not modified.
.El
.Ss TC-05 \(em Add subscription: field too long
.Bl -tag -width "Expected" -compact
.It Input
.Ic POST /podcast/index.cgi/save
with
.Va title
set to 257 bytes.
.It Expected
HTTP 200, error partial containing
.Dq A field value is too long.
.It Pass criterion
.Pa feeds.xml
is not modified.
.El
.Ss TC-06 \(em Add subscription: invalid enum value
.Bl -tag -width "Expected" -compact
.It Input
.Ic POST /podcast/index.cgi/save
with
.Va scope=invalid .
.It Expected
HTTP 200, error partial containing
.Dq Invalid value for constrained field.
.It Pass criterion
.Pa feeds.xml
is not modified.
.El
.Ss TC-07 \(em Edit subscription: round-trip
.Bl -tag -width "Expected" -compact
.It Input
.Ic GET /podcast/index.cgi/edit?id=0
followed by
.Ic POST /podcast/index.cgi/save
with
.Va id=0
and modified title.
.It Expected
Edit form pre-filled with existing values.
After save, card shows updated title.
.It Pass criterion
.Pa feeds.xml
contains updated title at position 0.
.El
.Ss TC-08 \(em Delete subscription
.Bl -tag -width "Expected" -compact
.It Input
.Ic POST /podcast/index.cgi/delete?id=0 .
.It Expected
HTTP 200, list partial without the deleted card.
.It Pass criterion
.Pa feeds.xml
does not contain the deleted entry.
.Ic xmlstarlet val
exits 0.
.El
.Ss TC-09 \(em Edit non-existent id
.Bl -tag -width "Expected" -compact
.It Input
.Ic GET /podcast/index.cgi/edit?id=99999 .
.It Expected
HTTP 200, error partial containing
.Dq Entry not found.
.It Pass criterion
No crash; worker continues accepting requests.
.El
.Ss TC-10 \(em feeds.xml atomic write: disk-full simulation
.Bl -tag -width "Expected" -compact
.It Input
Fill filesystem to near-capacity.
Attempt
.Ic POST /podcast/index.cgi/save
with valid fields.
.It Expected
HTTP 200, error partial containing
.Dq Failed to write feeds.xml.
.It Pass criterion
Original
.Pa feeds.xml
is unmodified.
.Pa feeds.xml.tmp
does not exist after the failed write.
.El
.Ss TC-11 \(em feeds.xml load: symlink rejection
.Bl -tag -width "Expected" -compact
.It Input
Replace
.Pa feeds.xml
with a symlink before starting the worker.
.It Expected
Worker exits with status 1 at startup; does not follow the symlink.
.It Pass criterion
Worker process terminates; HTTP server logs a FastCGI backend failure.
.El
.Ss TC-12 \(em Static analysis
.Bl -tag -width "Expected" -compact
.It Input
.Ic cppcheck --enable=all --std=c11 main.c
.It Expected
Zero findings of severity error, warning, or style.
.It Pass criterion
cppcheck XML output contains no
.Li <error>
elements with severity other than
.Li information .
.El
.Ss TC-13 \(em CVE scan
.Bl -tag -width "Expected" -compact
.It Input
OSV
.Pa /v1/querybatch
with all PURL-identified versioned components from
.Pa sbom.json .
.It Expected
Zero vulnerabilities returned for any component.
.It Pass criterion
All
.Li results[]
entries have empty
.Li vulns[]
arrays.
.El
.Ss TC-14 \(em podcast.sh: schedule filter
.Bl -tag -width "Expected" -compact
.It Input
Run
.Ic podcast.sh -v
at a time not matching any feed's day/pull_time.
.It Expected
Output contains
.Dq No podcasts scheduled for this time slot.\&
No files downloaded.
.It Pass criterion
.Va $DEST_DIR
is unchanged.
.El
.Ss TC-15 \(em podcast.sh: force flag
.Bl -tag -width "Expected" -compact
.It Input
.Ic podcast.sh -v -f -t \(lqTest Feed\(rq
against a feed with
.Va scope=latest .
.It Expected
One episode file created in
.Va $DEST_DIR .
Filename matches
.Li TestFeed_YYYY-MM-DD_*.mp3 .
.It Pass criterion
File exists and is non-zero bytes.
.El
.Sh TEST PROCEDURE SPECIFICATION (IEEE 829 \(sc 5.6)
.Ss TP-STATIC \(em Static analysis procedure
.Bl -enum -compact
.It
From the repository root:
.Dl cppcheck --enable=all --std=c11 --suppress=missingInclude --suppress=missingIncludeSystem --xml main.c 2>cppcheck.xml
.It
Inspect
.Pa cppcheck.xml
for
.Li <error>
elements.
.It
Record result in test log.
.El
.Ss TP-CVE \(em CVE scan procedure
.Bl -enum -compact
.It
Generate SBOM:
.Dl cdxgen -t c . -o sbom.json
.It
Submit PURL list to OSV
.Pa /v1/querybatch .
.It
Record all
.Li vulns[]
entries in test log.
.El
.Ss TP-MANUAL \(em Manual test procedure
.Bl -enum -compact
.It
Build:
.Dl cc -o nob nob.c && ./nob
.It
Start worker:
.Dl spawn-fcgi -p 9000 ./index.cgi
.It
Configure HTTP server to proxy
.Pa /podcast/
to port 9000.
.It
Execute TC-01 through TC-11 in sequence using a browser and
.Xr curl 1 .
.It
Record pass/fail for each case.
.El
